cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "geochem: Wrangling, Analysing, and Visualization of Geochemical Data"
abstract: >-
  An R package to wrangle and analyse geochemical data. Includes functions for
  element conversion, desurveying and projecting drillhole data, classification
  diagrams, spider plots, and plotting laser maps and XMOD data.
authors:
  - given-names: Max
    family-names: Hohl
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1167-541X"
version: 0.1.1
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/muhohl/geochem"
url: "https://github.com/muhohl/geochem"
keywords:
  - R
  - geochemistry
  - drillhole
  - laser ablation
  - data visualization
